[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]

; PistolRig: a 2D cutout rig for the HUD (CHANGE-BRIEF.md clip 2, route 3).
; Written by Claude Code. Body is the pivot at the top of the grip (the
; hand); Slide and Mag are Node2D pivots under it, so the tilt carries them.
; Shapes are Polygon2D points written here (gun points right, +x). Mag is
; drawn first, behind the grip, so only its base plate shows at rest.
; The AnimationPlayer's root is PistolRig, so the brief's tracks are
; Body:rotation, Body/Slide:position:x and Body/Mag:position:y.

[ext_resource type="Animation" path="res://animations/pistol_reload.tres" id="1_reload"]

